  CONFIRMED --> CANCELED: 用户取消 / 顾问取消
  CONFIRMED --> CONFIRMED: 改期(重走容量校验)
  ARRIVED --> COMPLETED: 顾问填跟进结果(关注维度回写画像)
  ARRIVED --> CANCELED: 不允许(40931)
  COMPLETED --> CANCELED: 不允许(40931)
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELED --> [*]
  note right of CONFIRMED
    提醒任务(10min 一次)：
